(5135943, 746599, 32011, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the bokeh (think you were right in entering Personification though)... the background sets the scene well.  The low level in the perfume bottle makes it look like a nice skirt, and the hour curved pattern all work wonderfully.  In addition, I have to add a point or two for the connection between the object photographed and the person it''s representing.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the bokeh (think you were right in entering Personification though)... the background sets the scene well.  The low level in the perfume bottle makes it look like a nice skirt, and the hour curved pattern all work wonderfully.  In addition, I have to add a point or two for the connection between the object photographed and the person it''s representing.  Well done!', '2008-12-17 00:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5135957, 747625, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Good composition.  I feel that the DOF is a tad too shallow with the tip of the cotton bud out of focus... had the whole head been in focus, I think you might have had a winner.</td>', 'Great idea.  Good composition.  I feel that the DOF is a tad too shallow with the tip of the cotton bud out of focus... had the whole head been in focus, I think you might have had a winner.', '2008-12-17 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
