(5139987, 747251, 100727, '<td valign="top">It''s a very simple photo but straight forward.  I like it.  The photo stays true to the challenge -- personification.  The best thing in this photo is that it''s natural in a sense that it''s not made up like so many other photos in this challenge.  It''s not "engineered" or "constructed" to fit into the challenge.  On the technical side, the sky is a bit washed out.  Overall, I like the photo.</td>', 'It''s a very simple photo but straight forward.  I like it.  The photo stays true to the challenge -- personification.  The best thing in this photo is that it''s natural in a sense that it''s not made up like so many other photos in this challenge.  It''s not "engineered" or "constructed" to fit into the challenge.  On the technical side, the sky is a bit washed out.  Overall, I like the photo.', '2008-12-18 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
