(5146703, 747135, 30364, '<td valign="top">The sole entry of any ambition at all.  I''m as a rule indifferent to staged photographs, but I''ll admit that you have animated the inanimate on a level that far transcends kitchen implements and power sockets with happy or sad faces and other trivia.  It''s no small achievement to instead take a relatively featureless object and anthropomorphize it so convincingly.  The pin as Marcel Marceau!  <i>Abandonnés</i> indeed.</td>', 'The sole entry of any ambition at all.  I''m as a rule indifferent to staged photographs, but I''ll admit that you have animated the inanimate on a level that far transcends kitchen implements and power sockets with happy or sad faces and other trivia.  It''s no small achievement to instead take a relatively featureless object and anthropomorphize it so convincingly.  The pin as Marcel Marceau!  Abandonnés indeed.', '2008-12-22 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
