(5148124, 747251, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the stitchwork is about. Otherwise, it''s a good subject, but would benefit from more dramatic lighting and maybe a closer angle. Also, remember to blow your image up to 640 pixels wide next time.</td>', 'Not sure what the stitchwork is about. Otherwise, it''s a good subject, but would benefit from more dramatic lighting and maybe a closer angle. Also, remember to blow your image up to 640 pixels wide next time.', '2008-12-23 17:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
